Lab 3: Creating Custom Products and Repositories
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Create and configure custom products in Red Hat Satellite
Create and manage custom repositories for software packages
Link custom repositories to products for organized content management
Understand the relationship between products, repositories, and content views
Configure repository synchronization settings
Manage custom content lifecycle in Satellite
