Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with Red Hat Satellite concepts (organizations, locations)
Knowledge of RPM package management
Understanding of repository concepts in Linux
Access to Red Hat Satellite 6.x environment
Administrative privileges in Satellite
