Troubleshooting Common Issues
Repository Sync Failures
If repository synchronization fails:

Check the repository URL is accessible
Verify SSL certificates if using HTTPS
Confirm authentication credentials if required
Review sync logs in Monitor > Tasks
Product Creation Issues
If you cannot create products:

Verify you have the correct permissions
Check organization context is correct
Ensure product names are unique
Confirm you're not exceeding subscription limits
Repository Association Problems
If repositories don't appear under products:

Refresh the browser page
Verify the repository was created successfully
Check the product-repository relationship in the database if needed
