Custom Repository Commands
For advanced repository management, you can use hammer CLI:

# List all products
hammer product list --organization "Default Organization"

# Create product via CLI
hammer product create --name "CLI Product" --organization "Default Organization"

# Create repository via CLI
hammer repository create \
  --name "CLI Repository" \
  --product "CLI Product" \
  --content-type "yum" \
  --url "https://example.com/repo" \
  --organization "Default Organization"

# Sync repository
hammer repository synchronize \
  --name "CLI Repository" \
  --product "CLI Product" \
  --organization "Default Organization"
