Why This Matters
Custom products and repositories are fundamental to Satellite's content management capabilities. They allow organizations to:

Centralize custom software distribution across the infrastructure
Maintain version control for internal applications and configurations
Implement security policies through controlled content delivery
Reduce bandwidth usage through local repository caching
Ensure consistency across development, testing, and production environments
These skills are essential for the Red Hat Certified Specialist in Deployment and Systems Management exam and real-world Satellite administration. Understanding how to create, manage, and organize custom content enables you to build robust software delivery pipelines that meet enterprise requirements for security, compliance, and operational efficiency.

The knowledge gained in this lab provides the foundation for advanced Satellite topics including content views, composite content views, and automated content promotion workflows that are critical for large-scale infrastructure management.
